# TODO

## Query collection

`src/session/query.rs` currently falls short of the intended collection behavior:

- Names are resolved as devices are opened and lines inspected, so GPIO I/O can occur before a later unknown name is rejected.
- Repeated names and aliases trigger separate line-info reads. Result keys collapse repeated names, but aliases can observe different metadata for the same physical line.
- Backend inspection errors are propagated without adding the selected pin, device, and line context.

Pending fix: validate and deduplicate the full selection before GPIO I/O, reuse one snapshot per `(device, line)`, and add context to inspection errors.

